  "worked_solution": "The set $S$ contains all integers greater than or equal to $-25.$\n\nTherefore, the set can be written as\n\n$$\nS={x\\in Z\\,:\\,x\\ge -25}.\n$$\n\n**Note**: This definition is not unique. For example:\n\n- We can write $x>-26.$ This gives\n\n$$\nS={x\\in Z\\,:\\,x>-26}.\n$$",
